# game/tutorial.rpy:8
translate chinese tutorial_81186b84:

    # un "Hmm?"
    un "嗯？"

# game/tutorial.rpy:12
translate chinese tutorial_b15b5d21:

    # un "Oh, a new player!"
    un "哦，是个新玩家！"

# game/tutorial.rpy:21
translate chinese tutorial_f1d7d41d:

    # un "Well, hey there, mate!"
    un "哎呀，你好啊，伙计！"

# game/tutorial.rpy:22
translate chinese tutorial_383bee9c:

    # un "So, ya chose to give the game a go, hey?"
    un "你是要来试试这游戏，对吧？"

# game/tutorial.rpy:23
translate chinese tutorial_9b86f4b8:

    # un "Ain't that sweet of ya?"
    un "可真不错。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:24
translate chinese tutorial_4e274bf9:

    # un "But quite a ripper choice I must say!"
    un "而且我也得承认你挑游戏的眼光非常独到！"

# game/tutorial.rpy:25
translate chinese tutorial_db5f176f:

    # un "...Who am I and why am I talkin' like this?"
    un "……我是谁，我又为什么在跟你说话？"

# game/tutorial.rpy:26
translate chinese tutorial_d62388d4:

    # n "First up, my name is Naomi. I'm different from the rest of the characters in this game, you see?"
    n "首先，我叫娜奥米。我跟这游戏里的其他角色都不一样，你看出来了吗？"

# game/tutorial.rpy:27
translate chinese tutorial_2b1ea18e:

    # n "But I'll try and talk to ya more normal way now, 'kay?"
    n "但我会尽量用普通的方式跟你说话，OK？"

# game/tutorial.rpy:28
translate chinese tutorial_e47c3b11:

    # n "...Why am I different, ya ask?"
    n "……你问为什么我不一样？"

# game/tutorial.rpy:31
translate chinese tutorial_3d6b8f36:

    # n "That's because I'm the developer of the game!"
    n "那是因为我是这个游戏的作者！"

# game/tutorial.rpy:34
translate chinese tutorial_41df7470:

    # n "......"
    n "......"

# game/tutorial.rpy:35
translate chinese tutorial_b9df080c:

    # n "Hm? Ya think I'm kiddin'?"
    n "嗯？你觉得我在开玩笑？"

# game/tutorial.rpy:38
translate chinese tutorial_228e3b68:

    # n "Well..."
    n "行吧……"

# game/tutorial.rpy:39
translate chinese tutorial_627335d2:

    # n "Yer right, mate. I'm sure not the developer of the game. Haha!"
    n "猜得没错，伙计。我怎么可能是这游戏的作者。哈哈！"

# game/tutorial.rpy:48
translate chinese tutorial_08635af1:

    # n "But, NiiChan told me to talk to ya before ya dive down into the actual story and set yer expectations movin' forward."
    n "但是，作者Niichan让我在你开始游戏之前跟你聊聊天，好让你更加期待。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:49
translate chinese tutorial_cafe9721:

    # n "The game isn't that complicated, I'd say, it's fairly simple."
    n "这游戏一点也不复杂，要我说，真的特别简单。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:50
translate chinese tutorial_6674639f:

    # n "Most of the choices in-game consists of just two options. There will be three or probably more, but that will rarely happen."
    n "游戏里的大部分选择只有两个选项。有时候会有三个或者更多，但这种情况很少。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:51
translate chinese tutorial_2188d679:

    # n "If yer okay about playing a simple game and just want to enjoy the story, then good on ya~! Haha!"
    n "如果你想玩个简单的游戏或只是想看故事，那算来对地方了！哈哈！"

# game/tutorial.rpy:52
translate chinese tutorial_415b23d4:

    # n "Ya might think this is an actual revenge game 'cuz of what the title suggests, but sorry to say that it is not."
    n "你看到游戏标题之后可能会以为这是个报仇的游戏，但很遗憾地告诉你并不是这样的。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:53
translate chinese tutorial_d26a668a:

    # n "So if yer looking for revenge, this one is not for ya to play, mate. Ya might wanna close the game now."
    n "所以如果你想看报仇的故事，那这游戏并不适合你，伙计。你可以关掉游戏了。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:54
translate chinese tutorial_4c8eee43:

    # n "One more thing for ya to know, is that this game is not yer typical all lovey-dovey kind of game. That'd be boring."
    n "还有一件事，这游戏不是那种见一个上一个，一路操到底的游戏。那样就太无聊了。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:55
translate chinese tutorial_cff48d2d:

    # n "There will be characters you'll hate at the start, but everything is there for a reason. Ya won't know how to love if ya dunno how to hate, right?"
    n "会有让你一开始很讨厌的角色，但凡事都是有理由的。不先知道怎么恨的话，又怎么去爱呢，对吧？"

# game/tutorial.rpy:58
translate chinese tutorial_259c74c5:

    # n "Okie-dokie~! My time is almost up!"
    n "好了好了~！我的时间也快用完了！"

# game/tutorial.rpy:61
translate chinese tutorial_18ab63c3:

    # n "Opps! Just before I go, a menu button will appear at the top right corner of the screen once yer into the actual game."
    n "对了！在你实际进入游戏之后，右上角会有一个菜单按钮。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:62
translate chinese tutorial_d0340818:

    # n "You'll find tons of things in there, including game setting, love points for each character and a lot more."
    n "这里面你能找到很多东西，包括游戏设置，每个角色的爱情点数还有其他的。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:63
translate chinese tutorial_3d9291f7:

    # n "Also, I totally recommend to try NiiChan's other game called 'Life Changing Choices'."
    n "另外，我非常推荐你去玩玩Niichan的另一个游戏，'Life Changing Choices'。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:64
translate chinese tutorial_2d08c7a0:

    # n "Both games are hugely connected to each other and there are a lot of information here that might confuse ya later on, so I encourage ya to try it out."
    n "两个游戏之间有许多联系，之后游戏里也会出现一些你玩过那款游戏之后才能看懂的情节，所以我推荐你去试试。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:67
translate chinese tutorial_3a3d1130:

    # n "Alrighty then, let's get started! I'll see ya later~!"
    n "好嘞，那就准备开始吧！我们待会见哦~！"

# game/tutorial.rpy:68
translate chinese tutorial_46906447:

    # n "Catch'ya, mate!"
    n "我在游戏里等你，伙计！"
# TODO: Translation updated at 2022-03-21 15:31

# game/tutorial.rpy:54
translate chinese tutorial_04774c0c:

    # n "Also, this game has some anime vibe to it. It is subjective, but ya may find the stories cliche."
    n "还有，这游戏玩起来会有一种看动画一样的感觉。这很主观，但你可能觉得剧情很滥大街。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:55
translate chinese tutorial_3c292504:

    # n "That's how NiiChan wants it to be, so if yer not into these things, please refrain from movin' further into the game."
    n "但这就是作者的本意，所以如果你对这种故事不感兴趣，就不要再继续玩下去了。"

# game/tutorial.rpy:65
translate chinese tutorial_1ffac1d7:

    # n "And hey, I totally recommend to try NiiChan's other game called 'Life Changing Choices'."
    n "对了，我非常推荐你去玩玩Niichan的另一款游戏，“Life Changing Choices”。"
